1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,500
The direct road from home

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,438
to work takes ten minutes.

3
00:00:03,438 --> 00:00:05,062
Is there a faster way,

4
00:00:05,062 --> 00:00:06,063
and how would you know?

5
00:00:06,654 --> 00:00:08,154
Dijkstra keeps a guess

6
00:00:08,154 --> 00:00:11,217
for each place: zero for home,

7
00:00:11,217 --> 00:00:12,917
infinity for the rest,

8
00:00:12,917 --> 00:00:15,242
in a queue sorted smallest first.

9
00:00:15,867 --> 00:00:17,729
Take the smallest, home,

10
00:00:17,729 --> 00:00:18,780
and lock it in.

11
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,405
Then relax its roads:

12
00:00:20,405 --> 00:00:22,792
cafe gets two, park five,

13
00:00:22,792 --> 00:00:23,542
work ten.

14
00:00:24,187 --> 00:00:25,912
Next is cafe, at two.

15
00:00:25,912 --> 00:00:27,075
Through cafe,

16
00:00:27,075 --> 00:00:28,800
park drops from five to three,

17
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:29,938
and shop gets eight.

18
00:00:30,533 --> 00:00:31,958
Why trust park's three?

19
00:00:31,958 --> 00:00:33,083
Any other route has to

20
00:00:33,083 --> 00:00:35,295
leave the finished places somewhere,

21
00:00:35,295 --> 00:00:36,545
and every exit already

22
00:00:36,545 --> 00:00:38,358
costs three or more.

23
00:00:38,358 --> 00:00:39,970
Roads only add minutes.

24
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:42,038
So park is locked in.

25
00:00:42,038 --> 00:00:44,263
Its road back to cafe gives four,

26
00:00:44,263 --> 00:00:45,400
worse than two,

27
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:47,100
but shop drops to five,

28
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:47,962
and work to nine.

29
00:00:48,567 --> 00:00:50,630
Shop is next, at five,

30
00:00:50,630 --> 00:00:52,242
and work drops to six.

31
00:00:52,242 --> 00:00:53,479
Then work comes out last.

32
00:00:54,067 --> 00:00:55,054
Now walk back from work

33
00:00:55,054 --> 00:00:57,630
to whoever set each guess: shop,

34
00:00:57,630 --> 00:00:59,417
park, cafe, home.

35
00:00:59,417 --> 00:01:00,854
Six minutes, not ten.

36
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:02,392
That's Dijkstra:

37
00:01:02,754 --> 00:01:04,117
lock in the smallest guess,

38
00:01:04,117 --> 00:01:06,092
relax its roads, repeat.

39
00:01:06,092 --> 00:01:08,130
It only works because no

40
00:01:08,130 --> 00:01:10,130
road takes negative minutes.
